---
import ContactLinks from './ContactLinks.astro';
import HeroBackdrop from './HeroBackdrop.astro';
import Portrait from './Portrait.astro';

const rotatorLines = [
  "We have AI access now, but the tools aren't making us faster",
  "We have immense output, but verification is our bottleneck",
  "We track AI spend perfectly, but the bottom line moves in the wrong direction!",
  "We're a <s>hardware</s> business, AI can't help us here",
  "We're an <s>infrastructure</s> business, AI can't help us here",
  "We're a <s>R&amp;D lab</s>, mainstream AI can't help us"
];
---
<section class="hero-section" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-backdrop-shell">
    <HeroBackdrop />
  </div>
  <div class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Enterprise AI, data, and workflow delivery</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">
        <span class="hero-rotator" data-lines={JSON.stringify(rotatorLines)}>
          <span class="hero-rotator-line" set:html={rotatorLines[0]} />
        </span>
      </h1>
      <div class="hero-copy-flow">
        <p class="hero-subline">AI is an amplifier of your processes: better process leads to much better and faster AI ROI.</p>
        <div class="hero-support">
          <p>But you don't have the time to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>figure out where <em>current</em> AI capabilities maximize benefit</li>
            <li>while making sure <em>future</em> capabilities don't replace today's projects</li>
            <li>across teams, departments, locations, jurisdictions ...</li>
          </ul>
          <p>And where are you going to get the people you need to do it all?</p>
          <p class="hero-closing">You don't have to feel like drowning in an ocean of opportunity.<br/>From strategy down to ML engineering: I get you to your destination faster and avoid unnecessary detours. </p>
        </div>
        <ContactLinks />
        <p class="hero-closing-small">< 48 hr response time</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-rail" aria-label="Credibility rail">
      <div class="hero-proof">
        <p class="hero-proof-label">Selected proof</p>
        <h2>Benefit from 10 yrs of experience:</h2>
        <ul class="hero-proof-list">
          <li>Logistics/Robotics: rapid deployment of swarm robot warehouses, predictive health for logistics personnel</li>
          <li>ML/Data Science: Fuel-Cell Control Algorithms, Real-Time Data Pipelines @ DLR e.V., User-AI Alignment, Private AI Search and contextual doc processing</li>
          <li>Computer Vision: Potato Quality Assurance, Automous Driving Data Collection, Smart City Applications</li>
          <li>Manufacturing: Production Automation, self-service customer support, predictive procurement optimization, AI-driven due diligence</li>
          <li>Finance: MBSE-inspired Smart Contract Architecture and Optimization, Due Diligence Automation, Self-Improving Agentic Software Strategy and Development</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <Portrait />
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/hero-rotator';
</script>
